#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2364
msgid ""
"Suppose you want to perform a principal component analysis on the data given"
" in <xref linkend=\"pcanalysis-example-1\"/> having the two dimensions "
"(factors) <inlineequation><_:mathphrase-1/></inlineequation> and "
"<inlineequation><_:mathphrase-2/></inlineequation>."
msgstr ""
"Anta att du vill utföra en principalkomponentanalys av data i <xref "
"linkend=\"pcanalysis-example-1\"/> med två dimensioner (faktorer), "
"<inlineequation><_:mathphrase-1/></inlineequation> och "
"<inlineequation><_:mathphrase-2/></inlineequation>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2370
msgid ""
"Enter Sheet1!$A$1:$B$11 (or just A1:B11) in the <quote><guilabel>Input "
"Range:</guilabel></quote> entry by typing this directly into the entry or "
"clicking in the entry field and then selecting the range on the sheet."
msgstr ""
"Ange Sheet1!$A$1:$B$11 (eller bara A1:B11) i fältet "
"<quote><guilabel>Indataområde:</guilabel></quote>. Skriv in området direkt "
"eller klicka i fältet och markera området i kalkylbladet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2375
msgid ""
"Select the <quote><guibutton>Labels</guibutton></quote> option since the "
"first row contains labels. (see <xref linkend=\"pcanalysis-tool-dialog\"/>)."
msgstr ""
"Markera alternativet <quote><guibutton>Rubriker</guibutton></quote> eftersom"
" den första raden innehåller rubriker (se <xref linkend=\"pcanalysis-tool-"
"dialog\"/>)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2382
msgid ""
"The output of this principal component analysis is shown in <xref "
"linkend=\"regression-example-3\"/>. The output shows the covariance matrix, "
"the eigenvalues and corresponding eigenvectors. The principal component is "
"the constructed factor with the highest percent of trace, "
"<inlineequation><_:mathphrase-1/></inlineequation>."
msgstr ""
"Resultatet av principalkomponentanalysen visas i <xref linkend=\"regression-"
"example-3\"/>. Det visar kovariansmatrisen, egenvärdena och motsvarande "
"egenvektorer. Huvudkomponenten är den konstruerade faktor som står för "
"störst andel av den totala variansen, "
"<inlineequation><_:mathphrase-1/></inlineequation>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2390
msgid "Principal Component Analysis Tool Output"
msgstr "Resultat från verktyget Principalkomponentanalys"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2392
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-pcanalysis-"
"ex2.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of "
"the output from a principal component analysis.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-pcanalysis-"
"ex2.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Resultat från"
" en principalkomponentanalys.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2409
msgid "Regression Tool"
msgstr "Regressionsverktyg"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2411
msgid "Regression Tool Dialog"
msgstr "Dialogruta för regressionsverktyget"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2413
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-regression.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of the "
"regression tool dialog.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-regression.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Dialogruta för "
"regressionsverktyget.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2424
msgid "The regression tool performs a multiple regression analysis."
msgstr "Regressionsverktyget utför en multipel regressionsanalys."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2425
msgid ""
"Enter a range or list of ranges containing the independent variables into "
"the <quote><guilabel>X Variables:</guilabel></quote> entry."
msgstr ""
"Ange ett område eller en lista med områden som innehåller de oberoende "
"variablerna i fältet <quote><guilabel>X-variabler:</guilabel></quote>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2427
msgid ""
"Enter a single range containing the dependent variable into the "
"<quote><guilabel>Y Variable:</guilabel></quote> entry."
msgstr ""
"Ange ett område som innehåller den beroende variabeln i fältet "
"<quote><guilabel>Y-variabel:</guilabel></quote>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2429
msgid ""
"If the ranges for the independent and dependent variables also contains "
"labels in the first field of each row, column or area, select the <quote> "
"<guilabel>Labels</guilabel></quote> option."
msgstr ""
"Om områdena med oberoende och beroende variabler även har rubriker i den "
"första cellen i varje rad, kolumn eller område markerar du alternativet "
"<quote><guilabel>Rubriker</guilabel></quote>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2432
msgid ""
"Specify the confidence level in the <quote><guilabel>Confidence "
"Level:</guilabel></quote> entry. The default is 95%."
msgstr ""
"Ange konfidensnivån i fältet "
"<quote><guilabel>Konfidensnivå:</guilabel></quote>. Standardvärdet är 95 %."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2434
msgid ""
"To force the regression line or plane to pass through the origin, select the"
" <quote><guilabel>Force Intercept To Be Zero</guilabel></quote> option."
msgstr ""
"Om du vill tvinga regressionslinjen eller regressionsplanet genom origo "
"markerar du alternativet <quote><guilabel>Tvinga skärningen till "
"noll</guilabel></quote>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2436
msgid ""
"Specify the output options as described above. If the output is directed "
"into a specific output range, that range should contain at least seven "
"columns and 17 rows more than there are independent variables."
msgstr ""
"Ange utdatainställningarna enligt beskrivningen ovan. Om resultatet ska "
"placeras i ett visst utdataområde måste området ha minst sju kolumner och 17"
" rader utöver antalet oberoende variabler."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2442
msgid "Regression Example Data"
msgstr "Exempeldata för regressionsanalys"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2444
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-regression-"
"ex1.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of "
"example data for use with the regression tool.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-regression-"
"ex1.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Exempeldata "
"för regressionsverktyget.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2458
msgid "Using the Regression Tool"
msgstr "Använda regressionsverktyget"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2460
msgid ""
"Suppose you want to perform a regression analysis on the data given in <xref"
" linkend=\"regression-example-1\"/> using <parameter>v</parameter> and "
"<parameter>y</parameter> as independent variables and "
"<parameter>u</parameter> as dependent variable."
msgstr ""
"Anta att du vill utföra en regressionsanalys av data i <xref "
"linkend=\"regression-example-1\"/> med <parameter>v</parameter> och "
"<parameter>y</parameter> som oberoende variabler och "
"<parameter>u</parameter> som beroende variabel."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2467
msgid ""
"Enter B1:C11 in the <quote><guilabel>X Variables:</guilabel></quote> entry "
"by typing this directly into the entry or clicking in the entry field and "
"then selecting the range on the sheet."
msgstr ""
"Ange B1:C11 i fältet <quote><guilabel>X-variabler:</guilabel></quote>. Skriv"
" in området direkt eller klicka i fältet och markera området i kalkylbladet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2472
msgid ""
"Enter A1:A11 in the <quote><guilabel>Y Variable:</guilabel></quote> entry."
msgstr "Ange A1:A11 i fältet <quote><guilabel>Y-variabel:</guilabel></quote>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2475
msgid ""
"Select the <quote><guibutton>Labels</guibutton></quote> option since the "
"first row contains labels. (see <xref linkend=\"regression-example-2\"/>)."
msgstr ""
"Markera alternativet <quote><guibutton>Rubriker</guibutton></quote> eftersom"
" den första raden innehåller rubriker (se <xref linkend=\"regression-"
"example-2\"/>)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2482
msgid ""
"The output of this regression analysis is shown in <xref "
"linkend=\"regression-example-3\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Resultatet av regressionsanalysen visas i <xref linkend=\"regression-"
"example-3\"/>."

