#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2519
msgid "One Sample Tests"
msgstr "Test med ett stickprov"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2523
msgid "The normality test tool provides for four tests of normality."
msgstr ""
"Verktyget för normalitetstest erbjuder fyra olika test av normalfördelning."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2531
msgid "Normality Test Dialog"
msgstr "Dialogruta för normalitetstest"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2533
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-normality.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of the "
"normality test dialog.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-normality.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Dialogruta för "
"normalitetstest.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2544
msgid ""
"The data range is specified via the <quote><guilabel>Input "
"Range:</guilabel></quote> entry (see <xref linkend=\"normality-tool-"
"dialog\"/>). The given range or list of ranges can be grouped into separate "
"data sets by columns, rows, or areas. The tool performs a separate test for "
"each data set."
msgstr ""
"Ange dataområdet i fältet <quote><guilabel>Indataområde:</guilabel></quote> "
"(se <xref linkend=\"normality-tool-dialog\"/>). Området eller områdeslistan "
"kan delas in i separata datamängder efter kolumner, rader eller områden. "
"Verktyget utför ett separat test för varje datamängd."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2551
msgid "Test Tab of the Normality Test Dialog"
msgstr "Fliken Test i dialogrutan för normalitetstest"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2553
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-normality-"
"testspec.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image"
" of the test tab of the normality test dialog.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-normality-"
"testspec.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Fliken "
"Test i dialogrutan för normalitetstest.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2565
msgid ""
"On the test tab one specifies which of the four tests to perform, the "
"significance level for the test and whether to include a normal probability "
"plot of the data (see <xref linkend=\"normality-tool-testspec-dialog\"/>)."
msgstr ""
"På fliken Test väljer du vilket av de fyra testen som ska utföras, anger "
"testets signifikansnivå och väljer om ett normalfördelningsdiagram ska tas "
"med (se <xref linkend=\"normality-tool-testspec-dialog\"/>)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2570
msgid "Normality Test Example Data"
msgstr "Exempeldata för normalitetstest"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2572
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-normality-ex1.png\""
" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of example "
"data for a normality test.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-normality-ex1.png\""
" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Exempeldata för "
"normalitetstest.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2585
msgid "Using the Normality Test Tool"
msgstr "Använda verktyget för normalitetstest"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2587
msgid ""
"Suppose you want to perform a Lilliefors (Kolmogorov-Smirnov) Test for "
"Normality on the data given in <xref linkend=\"normality-example-1\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Anta att du vill utföra ett Lilliefors-test (Kolmogorov–Smirnov-test) av "
"normalfördelning på data i <xref linkend=\"normality-example-1\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2592
msgid ""
"Enter A1:A50 (or Sheet1!$A$1:$A$50) in the <quote><guilabel>Input "
"Range:</guilabel></quote> entry by typing this directly into the entry or "
"clicking in the entry field and then selecting the range on the sheet."
msgstr ""
"Ange A1:A50 (eller Sheet1!$A$1:$A$50) i fältet "
"<quote><guilabel>Indataområde:</guilabel></quote>. Skriv in området direkt "
"eller klicka i fältet och markera området i kalkylbladet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2598
msgid ""
"Select the <quote><guibutton>Labels</guibutton></quote> option since the "
"first row contains a label (see <xref linkend=\"normality-example-2\"/>)."
msgstr ""
"Markera alternativet <quote><guibutton>Rubriker</guibutton></quote> eftersom"
" den första raden innehåller en rubrik (se <xref linkend=\"normality-"
"example-2\"/>)."
